    "reviews": "\u201cProfessional Review by an Italian webzine, A light wargame and very suitable for multiplayer: World War 2 Operation Husky is a nice diversion for the summer period... Read more.\u201d<br>RECOMMENDED by Tana Del Cobra<br><br>\u201cComplex but thanks to readily UI it's easy to understand controls. Simple mechanics, many strategies worth trying, diversity of war units and much more. Perfect for World War II fans!\u201d<br>100% \u2013 RECOMMENDED by Universal-Gamers<br><br>\u201cWorld War 2 Operation Husky&quot; is an accessible ww2 turn-based strategy wargame with various units to manage, simple and clear ui, good variety of mission to complete, give it a try!\u201d<br>100% \u2013 RECOMMENDED by Gaming Grandma<br>",
